WEBVTT

29:30.837 --> 29:33.798
- (HAMMERING)
- ..22, 23,

29:33.923 --> 29:37.719
24, 5, 6, 27,

29:37.844 --> 29:39.554
- 28, 29...
- Ser Hugh?

29:39.679 --> 29:41.681
30, 31, 32...

29:41.806 --> 29:43.975
- Ser Hugh!
- As you can see, I'm busy.

29:44.100 --> 29:49.272
I'm here on behalf of Lord Eddard Stark,
the Hand of the King.

29:49.397 --> 29:52.901
- I'm the captain of his guard.
- I'm sorry. I didn't catch your name, Ser...

29:53.026 --> 29:56.112
- No "ser". I'm not a knight.
- I see.

29:56.237 --> 29:58.907
Well, it just so happens that I am.
